# Vanilla 26.2 trace 'tnt', recorded on a real server (/tick freeze + /tick step 1, RCON probes).
# Coordinates relative to the scenario origin; y=0 is the first air layer above a stone floor.
# build: /setblock before t=0 (then 4 ticks settle); action t: /setblock between tick t and t+1 (before
# the t row is probed); row t: probed states after t ticks (only changes after the first row).
build 1 0 0 tnt
action 0 0 0 0 redstone_block
probe tnt 1 0 0
row 0 tnt=air primed_tnt=1
row 80 primed_tnt=0
end 84
